{"h": "7aed79f7bc7588a5", "text": "发烧时剪辑真帅，字体藏在黑屏里。", "src": "own_practice", "license": "自有账号实际发布（已过全部闸）", "use": "train", "kind": "其他", "seg": "craft_learner", "thread": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Vm4y1N7x3/", "ts": "2026-11-19T18:36:37"}
{"h": "b527a65f9104ab5b", "text": "别光理论，先从提升单节剪辑效率开始。", "src": "own_practice", "license": "自有账号实际发布（已过全部闸）", "use": "train", "kind": "其他", "seg": "craft_learner", "thread": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sf4y1X7AD/", "ts": "2026-11-19T19:44:59"}
{"h": "c59d91867311d3e9", "text": "你真本末倒置，剪辑本该是为内容服务，而非炫技，这样教学算哪门手艺。", "src": "own_practice", "license": "自有账号实际发布（已过全部闸）", "use": "train", "kind": "其他", "seg": "craft_learner", "thread": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV134516pEZe/", "ts": "2026-11-19T20:48:31"}
